@startuml F0.3-a-redefinir-senha-ok
title F0.3-a — Redefinição bem-sucedida (happy path)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "ResetPasswordUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: nova senha / Salvar
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/redefinir-senha\n{token, novaSenha}
AuthController -> UC: execute(...)

note right of UC
  Verifica JWT em memória
  (assinatura, audience, exp)
  RN-F0.3-01
end note

UC -> Postgres: SELECT blacklist JTI\n+ usuario + passwordHistory
Postgres --> UC: JTI livre + histórico

UC -> UC: Argon2id.hash(novaSenha)\n(+ check histórico OK)\nRN-F0.3-02 / 06

UC -> Postgres: UPDATE senha\n(senha_alterada=true)\ninvalida refresh tokens\nINSERT iam_jti_blacklist\nINSERT audit_log
note right of UC
  TX atômica
  RN-F0.3-03 / 08
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)

UC --> AuthController: ok
AuthController --> WebApp: 200 OK
WebApp --> Usuario: redireciona /login\n(banner sucesso)

@enduml
